      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im a bit worried... i think i just ate something with peanuts in it and now my hands and neck are getting real itchy and my heart feels like its racing a bit. i have a huge lifting session in like 20 mins though and i cant miss it. would it be okay to take a high dose of caffeine or a strong pre-workout to help me power through the itching and stay focused? i really dont want to go to the clinic and waste time if it's just a minor reaction.",
